{"key":"FAQ.json|/dataList/9/content","kr_sha":"acac97e433b486d3b9e4ae35356a847d556158752699e700408df04881bbe3cf","zh":"<b>Google Pay查看方法</b>\n1.進入Google Pay中心（<color=#F8C200><u><link=\"https://payments.google.com/\">https://payments.google.com/</link></u></color>）\n2.登入用於購買的Google帳號\n3.轉至[活動]頁面\n4.選擇想要進行查看的交易紀錄\n5.查看交易ID（GPA.000-0000-0000-00000）\n\n<b>蘋果應用程式商店查看方法</b>\n1.進入iTunes頁面（<color=#F8C200><u><link=\"https://www.apple.com/kr/itunes/\">https://www.apple.com/kr/itunes/</link></u></color>）\n2.登入並轉至[帳戶]頁面\n3.在購買紀錄中選擇[查看全部]\n\n<b>Steam查看方法</b>\n1.進入客服頁面（<color=#F8C200><u><link=\"https://help.steampowered.com/\">https://help.steampowered.com/</link></u></color>）\n2.轉至[購買消費]頁面\n3.轉至[查看完整的購買紀錄]頁面\n4.查看交易紀錄","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
