{"key":"FAQ.json|/dataList/25/content","kr_sha":"e896a60ba5f250b8f3f45e99a20c8121bb73f0face9c96779f2ec3b40d2fb90e","zh":"如果您忘記了綁定了遊戲的帳號ID或密碼，請聯繫相應服務平臺的客服尋求幫助。\n\nGoogle客服：<color=#F8C200><u><link=\"https://support.google.com/accounts/#topic=3382296\">https://support.google.com/accounts/#topic=3382296</link></u></color>\n蘋果客服：<color=#F8C200><u><link=\"https://support.apple.com/ko-kr\">https://support.apple.com/ko-kr</link></u></color>\nSteam客服：<color=#F8C200><u><link=\"https://help.steampowered.com/ko/wizard/HelpWithPurchase.Vender+cromos+raacutepidamente+con+Steam+In\">https://help.steampowered.com/ko/wizard/HelpWithPurchase.Vender+cromos+raacutepidamente+con+Steam+In</link></u></color>\n\n※注意事項\n請注意，在遷移設備或刪除應用程式時，未進行過綁定的遊客帳號可能會永久丟失。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
